.SH NAME
dotty-dotfiles-edit - Proxy mise dot edit against the selected profile.


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdotty dotfiles edit [mise arguments] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Forward arguments and flags to mise dot edit. Run with --help for mise's command help.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for edit


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--profile\fP=""
	profile to operate on (defaults to the active profile)

.PP
\fB--repo\fP=""
	dotfiles repository (default: found via $REPOS_DIR)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  dotty dotfiles edit --help
.EE


